{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4b48b857d6b39c64f25667548544d63594592e05a306dd2c9914da8bdc24af04","ja":"イエス、イエス！　ベースボール！\nカーブ、シンカー、フォーク！","zh":"Yes，Yes！棒球！\n曲球、伸卡球、指叉球！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3612e3a0b8aaf8132de4742043592a2ee1992092d352e735df594f8006952947","ja":"な、なんで、この会話で\n盛り上がるのよ……！？","zh":"怎、怎么会因为这种对话\n兴奋起来啊……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4311a87ef87560bf9a0c12ad9f7a1d7de6a33f8a623a3033b17021c337a64b77","ja":"いやー、伊織の言った通りだな！\n思い切って話してみたら、なんとかなったよ！","zh":"哎呀，真被伊织说中了！\n鼓起勇气试着说了说，还真给解决了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"dc7647f9f53282d5bf0c89fe985802496503be45ef134db3f86c0764898098a8","ja":"そうね！　言葉は何となくだけど、\n気持ちはバッチリ伝わったわ！","zh":"说得对！虽然语言只懂了个大概，\n但心意已经完全传达过来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"35df1bc1f282eff2f0e49ac8b1878a00b687dcee8f2cb1cc11d5d7c334e5358c","ja":"そっ……それは……。","zh":"那、那是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1292.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"750bbe6d0b75d1668df70421c3611857b5f38a97f9023571eab0bf3853cd5e35","ja":"と、当然でしょ！　伊織ちゃんの言うことに\n間違いはないんだからねっ！！","zh":"理、理所当然吧！伊织说的话\n怎么可能会有错嘛！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
